<BaseLayout title="The Time AI Saved You, Where Did It Really Go? — BanbaiGuan AI" jsonLd={articleJsonLd} ogDescription="In 2026, the global tech industry laid off 116,000 people, 40% of jobs reshaped by AI. But those who remain are busier than ever." navActive="banbaiguan" lang="en">
